(text "Miata ECU motherboard 2001-2005 (NB2, VVT). Carries the year-specific harness header and the year-independent I/O (wideband, MAP, IAT, USB-C). All engine control is on the daughterboard." (at 30.48 100.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7777dc80-1449-4e7b-a9e8-51b22da913bd)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))